# Images of the keyboard's own firmware — not this work, and not distributed here.
#
# `k10max_FACTORY_original_256k.bin` is a dump of this board's factory flash and
# `k10max_STOCK_rollback.bin` is the vendor stock image used to roll a flash back.
# Both are Keychron's. Their SHA-256 are recorded in README.md so an image obtained
# from the vendor (or dumped from your own board) can be checked against the ones
# this work used. The files stay in the working tree so a flash can still be undone.
firmware/k10max_FACTORY_original_256k.bin
firmware/k10max_STOCK_rollback.bin
